DESCRIPTION:Please join us for our Third Annual Maker’s Market! 🎨✨
 🛍️\nSupport talented student creatives and discover unique\, handmade
  goods 💛\n\n📅 May 6th\n⏰ 12 PM – 4 PM\n📍 Student Community Ce
 nter\, Multipurpose Room (2nd Floor)\n\nEnjoy free refreshments and snacks
  🍿🧃 and take part in fun FREE activities 🎉🎨 while exploring st
 udent-run booths and creative work!\n\nBring your friends\, support local 
