SUMMARY:WSAC Wednesday Afternoon Visibility Brigade
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260520T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260520T173000
UID:26477fb9dc35c1a675189bd5d33040c1@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Friday%20brigade_20260120001226221907.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join the WSAC Visibility Brigade each Wednesday afternoon at 4
 :30 to make VISIBLE our opposition to the endless corruption\, incompetenc
 e\, and immorality of the current regime. We display messages to commuters
